{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>להקריב את קרבניהם לה׳ במדבר סיני</b> — for they did not offer a sacrifice until they came to the wilderness of Sinai. And the altar that Moses built in the war with Amalek was at Chorev, which is Mount Sinai, and there Israel stayed nearly a full year, for on the first of Sivan of the first year they came to Mount Sinai, and it is written, ״בשנה השנית בחדש השני בעשרים לחדש נעלה הענן״ etc. And in the rest of the wilderness they did not offer sacrifices, as the prophet said, ״הזבחים ומנחה הגשתם לי בני ישראל במדבר״ etc., and also the Pesach they did not perform except in Egypt and in the wilderness of Sinai, and the sacrifices of Yom HaKippurim in the second year."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:39.617802686Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}